{"meta":{"id":"tt26351129","type":"series","name":"Secretos de los Elefantes","imdb_id":"tt26351129","description":"Son poderosos, cariñosos y sabios, pero recién ahora estamos empezando a descubrir los secretos más profundos de los elefantes. Su pensamiento estratégico, sus complejas emociones y su sofisticado lenguaje han creado una cultura única y dinámica que los asemeja a nosotros más de lo que jamás creímos posible. Esta serie cambiará para siempre todo lo que creías saber sobre los elefantes.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt26351129.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zaEsVSrzHqFw3umnLHSS59fb2X2.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dWisJW0LwazObVSKZAhdo952c5K.png","genres":["Documental"],"releaseInfo":"2023","released":"2023-04-21T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","imdbRating":"8.2","country":"United Kingdom, United States of America","cast":["Natalie Portman","Paula Kahumbu","Joyce Poole"],"director":["Glenn Barden"],"writer":["Fleur Bone","Glenn Barden","Josh Helliker"],"trailers":[{"source":"fc-PYHTN1UU","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"fc-PYHTN1UU","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"fc-PYHTN1UU","title":"Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"8.2","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt26351129"},{"name":"Documental","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Documental"},{"name":"Natalie Portman","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Natalie%20Portman"},{"name":"Paula Kahumbu","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Paula%20Kahumbu"},{"name":"Joyce Poole","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Joyce%20Poole"},{"name":"Glenn Barden","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Glenn%20Barden"},{"name":"Fleur Bone","category":"Writers","url":"stremio:///search?search=Fleur%20Bone"},{"name":"Glenn Barden","category":"Writers","url